owo_binop: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_binop: operands def:a def:b; minted b a
owo_binop: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_binop: two scopes, the second operand's minted first: true
owo_ternop: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_ternop: operands def:a def:b def:c; minted c b a
owo_ternop: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_ternop: three scopes, minted last operand first: true
owo_cse: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_cse: operands read:a def:a; minted a
owo_cse: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_cse: the first operand reads the scope the second defines: true
owo_cse_between: every producer virtualizes: true
owo_cse_between: operands read:a def:b def:a; minted a b
owo_cse_between: the run gives the closed form: true
owo_cse_between: the last copy survives, read by the first; the middle operand is minted after it: true
